{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05375","headline":"奉和御制左丞相说右丞相璟太子少傅乾曜同日上官命宴都堂赐诗 · 萧嵩","name":"奉和御制左丞相说右丞相璟太子少傅乾曜同日上官命宴都堂赐诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"审官思共理，多士属惟唐。\n历选台庭旧，来熙帝业昌。\n入朝师百辟，论道协三光。\n垂拱咨元老，亲贤辅少阳。\n登庸崇礼送，宠德耀宸章。\n御酒飞觞洽，仙闱雅乐张。\n荷恩思有报，陈力媿无良。\n愿罄公忠节，同心奉我皇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"萧嵩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05375.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05375","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}